{"seq":2,"slug":"rendering-pipeline","title":"渲染流水线","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/browser-and-web-api/browser-internals/rendering-pipeline","wordCount":899,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"渲染流水线\">渲染流水线</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>渲染流水线（关键渲染路径）把 HTML/CSS 文本逐步转化为屏幕像素，依次经过 <strong>DOM → CSSOM → 渲染树 → 布局 → 绘制 → 合成</strong> 六个阶段。变更触发的阶段越靠后开销越小：<strong>Reflow</strong> 重跑布局，<strong>Repaint</strong> 只重绘外观，<code>transform</code>/<code>opacity</code> 变更仅需合成。理解每个阶段由什么属性触发，是定位与优化渲染性能的基础。</p>\n<h2 id=\"从-html-到像素\">从 HTML 到像素</h2><p>当浏览器收到 HTML 响应后，需要经过一系列步骤将文本内容转化为屏幕上的像素。这个过程称为<strong>渲染流水线（Rendering Pipeline）</strong>，也叫关键渲染路径（Critical Rendering Path）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    HTML[&quot;HTML&quot;] --&gt; DOM[&quot;DOM 树&quot;]&#10;    CSS[&quot;CSS&quot;] --&gt; CSSOM[&quot;CSSOM 树&quot;]&#10;    DOM --&gt; RT[&quot;渲染树\\nRender Tree&quot;]&#10;    CSSOM --&gt; RT&#10;    RT --&gt; Layout[&quot;布局\\nLayout&quot;]&#10;    Layout --&gt; Paint[&quot;绘制\\nPaint&quot;]&#10;    Paint --&gt; Composite[&quot;合成\\nComposite&quot;]&#10;    Composite --&gt; Screen[&quot;屏幕像素&quot;]\">flowchart LR\n    HTML[\"HTML\"] --&gt; DOM[\"DOM 树\"]\n    CSS[\"CSS\"] --&gt; CSSOM[\"CSSOM 树\"]\n    DOM --&gt; RT[\"渲染树\\nRender Tree\"]\n    CSSOM --&gt; RT\n    RT --&gt; Layout[\"布局\\nLayout\"]\n    Layout --&gt; Paint[\"绘制\\nPaint\"]\n    Paint --&gt; Composite[\"合成\\nComposite\"]\n    Composite --&gt; Screen[\"屏幕像素\"]</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"各阶段详解\">各阶段详解</h2><h3 id=\"1-dom-构建\">1. DOM 构建</h3><p>HTML 解析器将字节流转换为 Token，再构建 DOM 树。这是一个增量过程，解析器遇到 <code>&lt;script&gt;</code> 标签时会暂停。</p>\n<h3 id=\"2-cssom-构建\">2. CSSOM 构建</h3><p>CSS 解析器将样式表解析为 CSSOM（CSS Object Model）。CSSOM 构建会阻塞渲染——浏览器必须等所有 CSS 加载完毕才开始布局。</p>\n<h3 id=\"3-渲染树构建\">3. 渲染树构建</h3><p>将 DOM 和 CSSOM 合并，生成渲染树。<code>display: none</code> 的元素不会进入渲染树，<code>visibility: hidden</code> 的元素会保留。</p>\n<h3 id=\"4-布局-layout-reflow\">4. 布局（Layout / Reflow）</h3><p>计算每个节点的精确位置和尺寸。布局从根节点开始，递归计算所有元素的几何信息。</p>\n<h3 id=\"5-绘制-paint\">5. 绘制（Paint）</h3><p>将渲染树中的节点转换为绘制指令（Paint Records），记录绘制顺序和操作。</p>\n<h3 id=\"6-合成-composite\">6. 合成（Composite）</h3><p>将不同图层的绘制结果合成到一起，由 GPU 最终输出到屏幕。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const observer = new PerformanceObserver((list) =&gt; {&#10;  for (const entry of list.getEntries()) {&#10;    console.log(`${entry.name}: ${entry.startTime.toFixed(2)}ms`);&#10;  }&#10;});&#10;observer.observe({ type: &#39;paint&#39;, buffered: true });\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> observer</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> PerformanceObserver</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">list</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> entry</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> of</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> list.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getEntries</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    console.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">log</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">entry</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">.</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">name</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}: ${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">entry</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">.</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">startTime</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">toFixed</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">)</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}ms`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">observer.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">observe</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ type: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'paint'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, buffered: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> });</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"reflow-与-repaint\">Reflow 与 Repaint</h2><p><strong>Reflow（回流/重排）</strong> 和 <strong>Repaint（重绘）</strong> 是渲染流水线中最常触发的性能瓶颈。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    Change[&quot;DOM/样式变更&quot;]&#10;    Change --&gt; Q1{&quot;是否影响几何属性?&quot;}&#10;    Q1 -- 是 --&gt; Reflow[&quot;Reflow\\n重新计算布局&quot;]&#10;    Q1 -- 否 --&gt; Q2{&quot;是否影响外观?&quot;}&#10;    Reflow --&gt; Repaint[&quot;Repaint\\n重新绘制&quot;]&#10;    Q2 -- 是 --&gt; Repaint&#10;    Q2 -- 否 --&gt; Composite[&quot;仅合成&quot;]&#10;    Repaint --&gt; Composite\">flowchart TD\n    Change[\"DOM/样式变更\"]\n    Change --&gt; Q1{\"是否影响几何属性?\"}\n    Q1 -- 是 --&gt; Reflow[\"Reflow\\n重新计算布局\"]\n    Q1 -- 否 --&gt; Q2{\"是否影响外观?\"}\n    Reflow --&gt; Repaint[\"Repaint\\n重新绘制\"]\n    Q2 -- 是 --&gt; Repaint\n    Q2 -- 否 --&gt; Composite[\"仅合成\"]\n    Repaint --&gt; Composite</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>操作</th>\n<th>触发阶段</th>\n<th>性能开销</th>\n<th>示例属性</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Reflow</td>\n<td>Layout → Paint → Composite</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td><code>width</code>, <code>height</code>, <code>margin</code>, <code>padding</code>, <code>font-size</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Repaint</td>\n<td>Paint → Composite</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td><code>color</code>, <code>background</code>, <code>border-color</code>, <code>visibility</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>仅合成</td>\n<td>Composite</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td><code>transform</code>, <code>opacity</code>, <code>will-change</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const element = document.getElementById(&#39;box&#39;)!;&#10;&#10;element.style.width = &#39;200px&#39;;&#10;element.style.height = &#39;100px&#39;;&#10;const computedHeight = element.offsetHeight;&#10;&#10;element.style.width = &#39;200px&#39;;&#10;element.style.height = &#39;100px&#39;;&#10;element.style.margin = &#39;10px&#39;;&#10;&#10;requestAnimationFrame(() =&gt; {&#10;  element.style.width = &#39;200px&#39;;&#10;  element.style.height = &#39;100px&#39;;&#10;  element.style.margin = &#39;10px&#39;;&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> element</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> document.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getElementById</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'box'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">element.style.width </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '200px'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">element.style.height </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '100px'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> computedHeight</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> element.offsetHeight;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">element.style.width </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '200px'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">element.style.height </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '100px'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">element.style.margin </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '10px'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">requestAnimationFrame</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  element.style.width </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '200px'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  element.style.height </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '100px'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  element.style.margin </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '10px'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 读取 <code>offsetHeight</code>、<code>getBoundingClientRect()</code> 等几何属性会强制浏览器执行同步布局（Forced Synchronous Layout），应尽量避免在修改样式后立即读取。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"强制同步布局与布局抖动\">强制同步布局与布局抖动</h2><p><strong>强制同步布局（Forced Synchronous Layout）</strong> 发生在 JS 修改样式后立即读取几何属性时。<strong>布局抖动（Layout Thrashing）</strong> 是在循环中反复触发强制同步布局。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const items = document.querySelectorAll&lt;HTMLElement&gt;(&#39;.item&#39;);&#10;&#10;for (const item of items) {&#10;  const width = item.offsetWidth;&#10;  item.style.width = `${width * 2}px`;&#10;}&#10;&#10;const widths: number[] = [];&#10;for (const item of items) {&#10;  widths.push(item.offsetWidth);&#10;}&#10;for (let i = 0; i &lt; items.length; i++) {&#10;  items[i].style.width = `${widths[i] * 2}px`;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> items</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> document.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">querySelectorAll</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">HTMLElement</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'.item'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> item</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> of</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> items) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> width</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> item.offsetWidth;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  item.style.width </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> `${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">width</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}px`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> widths</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> item</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> of</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> items) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  widths.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">push</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(item.offsetWidth);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> items.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; i</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  items[i].style.width </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> `${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">widths</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">[</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">i</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}px`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"图层提升-layer-promotion\">图层提升（Layer Promotion）</h2><p>浏览器将页面分为多个<strong>合成层（Compositing Layers）</strong>。某些条件会导致元素被提升为独立的合成层：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TB&#10;    Element[&quot;DOM 元素&quot;]&#10;    Element --&gt; Q1{&quot;有 3D transform?&quot;}&#10;    Q1 -- 是 --&gt; Layer[&quot;创建独立合成层&quot;]&#10;    Q1 -- 否 --&gt; Q2{&quot;有 will-change?&quot;}&#10;    Q2 -- 是 --&gt; Layer&#10;    Q2 -- 否 --&gt; Q3{&quot;有 opacity 动画?&quot;}&#10;    Q3 -- 是 --&gt; Layer&#10;    Q3 -- 否 --&gt; Q4{&quot;是固定定位?&quot;}&#10;    Q4 -- 是 --&gt; Layer&#10;    Q4 -- 否 --&gt; Normal[&quot;留在父图层&quot;]\">flowchart TB\n    Element[\"DOM 元素\"]\n    Element --&gt; Q1{\"有 3D transform?\"}\n    Q1 -- 是 --&gt; Layer[\"创建独立合成层\"]\n    Q1 -- 否 --&gt; Q2{\"有 will-change?\"}\n    Q2 -- 是 --&gt; Layer\n    Q2 -- 否 --&gt; Q3{\"有 opacity 动画?\"}\n    Q3 -- 是 --&gt; Layer\n    Q3 -- 否 --&gt; Q4{\"是固定定位?\"}\n    Q4 -- 是 --&gt; Layer\n    Q4 -- 否 --&gt; Normal[\"留在父图层\"]</pre><p>触发图层提升的常见条件：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>条件</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>transform: translateZ(0)</code> / <code>translate3d()</code></td>\n<td>显式 3D 变换</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>will-change: transform / opacity</code></td>\n<td>提前告知浏览器优化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>position: fixed</code></td>\n<td>固定定位元素</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>&lt;video&gt;</code> / <code>&lt;canvas&gt;</code> / <code>&lt;iframe&gt;</code></td>\n<td>特殊元素自动提升</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>与已提升元素重叠</td>\n<td>隐式提升（implicit promotion）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const card = document.querySelector&lt;HTMLElement&gt;(&#39;.card&#39;)!;&#10;card.style.willChange = &#39;transform&#39;;&#10;&#10;card.addEventListener(&#39;animationend&#39;, () =&gt; {&#10;  card.style.willChange = &#39;auto&#39;;&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> card</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> document.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">querySelector</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">HTMLElement</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'.card'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">card.style.willChange </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'transform'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">card.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">addEventListener</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'animationend'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  card.style.willChange </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'auto'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 过多的合成层会占用大量 GPU 内存。使用 Chrome DevTools 的 Layers 面板检查图层数量，避免不必要的层爆炸（Layer Explosion）。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"渲染流水线优化策略\">渲染流水线优化策略</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"function batchDOMUpdates(updates: Array&lt;() =&gt; void&gt;): void {&#10;  const fragment = document.createDocumentFragment();&#10;&#10;  requestAnimationFrame(() =&gt; {&#10;    for (const update of updates) {&#10;      update();&#10;    }&#10;  });&#10;}&#10;&#10;function useContainment(element: HTMLElement): void {&#10;  element.style.contain = &#39;layout style paint&#39;;&#10;}&#10;&#10;function smoothAnimation(element: HTMLElement, x: number, y: number): void {&#10;  element.style.transform = `translate(${x}px, ${y}px)`;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> batchDOMUpdates</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">updates</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Array</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> void</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> void</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> fragment</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> document.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">createDocumentFragment</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  requestAnimationFrame</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> update</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> of</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> updates) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">      update</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> useContainment</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">element</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> HTMLElement</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> void</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  element.style.contain </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'layout style paint'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> smoothAnimation</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">element</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> HTMLElement</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">x</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">y</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> void</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  element.style.transform </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> `translate(${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">x</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}px, ${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">y</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}px)`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>优化策略</th>\n<th>效果</th>\n<th>原理</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>批量 DOM 更新</td>\n<td>减少 reflow 次数</td>\n<td>合并多次修改为一次布局</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>requestAnimationFrame</code></td>\n<td>对齐帧刷新</td>\n<td>在下一帧前统一执行变更</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CSS <code>contain</code></td>\n<td>限制影响范围</td>\n<td>隔离元素的布局/绘制计算</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>transform</code> 动画</td>\n<td>跳过 Layout/Paint</td>\n<td>仅在合成线程处理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>content-visibility: auto</code></td>\n<td>跳过屏外渲染</td>\n<td>延迟不可见内容的渲染</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>渲染流水线包括 <strong>DOM → CSSOM → 渲染树 → 布局 → 绘制 → 合成</strong> 六个关键步骤</li>\n<li><strong>Reflow</strong> 触发完整重排，开销最大；<strong>Repaint</strong> 只重绘外观；<code>transform</code>/<code>opacity</code> 仅触发合成</li>\n<li>强制同步布局和布局抖动是常见性能陷阱，应<strong>先批量读取再批量写入</strong></li>\n<li>合理使用图层提升（<code>will-change</code>、<code>transform</code>）可将动画移至合成线程</li>\n<li>CSS <code>contain</code> 和 <code>content-visibility</code> 是现代浏览器提供的渲染优化利器</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"渲染流水线","id":"渲染流水线"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"从 HTML 到像素","id":"从-html-到像素"},{"level":2,"text":"各阶段详解","id":"各阶段详解"},{"level":3,"text":"1. DOM 构建","id":"1-dom-构建"},{"level":3,"text":"2. CSSOM 构建","id":"2-cssom-构建"},{"level":3,"text":"3. 渲染树构建","id":"3-渲染树构建"},{"level":3,"text":"4. 布局（Layout / Reflow）","id":"4-布局-layout-reflow"},{"level":3,"text":"5. 绘制（Paint）","id":"5-绘制-paint"},{"level":3,"text":"6. 合成（Composite）","id":"6-合成-composite"},{"level":2,"text":"Reflow 与 Repaint","id":"reflow-与-repaint"},{"level":2,"text":"强制同步布局与布局抖动","id":"强制同步布局与布局抖动"},{"level":2,"text":"图层提升（Layer Promotion）","id":"图层提升-layer-promotion"},{"level":2,"text":"渲染流水线优化策略","id":"渲染流水线优化策略"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"浏览器架构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/browser-and-web-api/browser-internals/browser-architecture"},"next":{"title":"V8 引擎","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/browser-and-web-api/browser-internals/v8-engine"}}